From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 07:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm: dw-dp: report AUX and connector detection failures

The connector currently becomes disconnected without a useful message when
the DesignWare AUX status register reports a hardware timeout.  Emit
rate-limited diagnostics for that condition and for PHY/link detection
failures so USB-C DP bring-up can distinguish HPD, PHY and DPCD failures.

This diagnostic can be dropped once the Orange Pi 5B USB-C DP path is stable
or upstream provides equivalent error reporting.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-dp.c | 14 +++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-dp.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-dp.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-dp.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-dp.c
@@ -1495,8 +1495,12 @@ static ssize_t dw_dp_aux_transfer(struct drm_dp_aux *aux,
 	}
 
 	regmap_read(dp->regmap, DW_DP_AUX_STATUS, &value);
-	if (value & AUX_TIMEOUT)
+	if (value & AUX_TIMEOUT) {
+		dev_err_ratelimited(dp->dev,
+				    "AUX hardware timeout: request %#x address %#x size %zu status %#x\n",
+				    msg->request, msg->address, msg->size, value);
 		return -ETIMEDOUT;
+	}
 
 	msg->reply = FIELD_GET(AUX_STATUS, value);
 
@@ -1712,10 +1716,15 @@ static bool dw_dp_hpd_detect_link(struct dw_dp *dp, struct drm_connector *connect
 
 	ret = phy_power_on(dp->phy);
-	if (ret < 0)
-		return false;
+	if (ret < 0) {
+		dev_err_ratelimited(dp->dev, "failed to power on DP PHY: %d\n", ret);
+		return false;
+	}
 	ret = dw_dp_link_parse(dp, connector);
 	phy_power_off(dp->phy);
 
+	if (ret < 0)
+		dev_err_ratelimited(dp->dev, "failed to detect DP sink over AUX: %d\n", ret);
+
 	return !ret;
 }
 
